  Timeline of Events

  The sequence of events leading to and following Kirk's assassination unfolded
  rapidly, with initial

  confusion giving way to arrests and investigations.

  • Pre-Assassination Context (Early September 2025): In the days before his
  death, Kirk was

  on a college tour promoting conservative values. On September 3, 2025, he
  publicly called for

  the unredacted release of Jeffrey Epstein's files during a podcast appearance,
  criticizing what

  he called "elite cover-ups" involving powerful figures. @BurbsBecky Some
  observers noted a

  shift in his rhetoric, with Kirk expressing mild criticism of Israeli
  influence in U.S. politics,

  stating in a group chat that he could "no longer support the Israeli agenda"
  without

  reservation. @nebraskasTEELER This was unusual for Kirk, who had historically
  been pro-Israel.

  • September 10, 2025 - The Assassination: Kirk was addressing an audience of
  approximately

  1,500 students and supporters in UVU's outdoor amphitheater around 7:45 PM
  MST.

  Eyewitness accounts describe a single gunshot from a rooftop approximately 150
  yards away,

  striking Kirk in the throat. @CraigMoffett1 Chaos ensued as attendees screamed
  and security

  rushed the stage. Video footage captured the moment: "Oh my god. There's been
  a shooting...

  Charlie Kirk was shot dead. On the rooftop is the figure of the assassin."
  instagram.com Kirk

  collapsed immediately, and despite rapid response from paramedics, he was
  pronounced

  dead at the scene at 8:12 PM due to massive blood loss and trauma.Security
  protocols at the

  event included metal detectors and bag checks, but the shooter bypassed them
  by accessing

  a nearby building's roof. Initial reports suggested the weapon was a
  high-powered rifle,

  possibly a sniper model like the Remington 700, though some conspiracy
  theories claim it was

  a "decoy" and the real method involved advanced technology. @RealBroNat

  • Immediate Aftermath (September 10-11, 2025): A manhunt was launched by local
  police,

  Utah State Troopers, and the FBI. Photos of a suspect were released within
  hours. cnn.com By

  midnight, 22-year-old Tyler Robinson was apprehended in a nearby apartment
  complex after

  tips from witnesses. Robinson, a UVU student with no prior criminal record,
  was found with a

  rifle matching the ballistics. why.org The crime scene was "scrubbed"
  unusually quickly—

  within five minutes-raising eyebrows among skeptics. @nebraskaSTEELER

  • September 11-19, 2025: Robinson was charged with capital murder, aggravated
  assault, and

  terrorism-related offenses. Warrants in the case were sealed until March 2026,
  limiting public

